| [[practical-wisdom]] | 2026-09-25 | 2026-09-25 | Phronesis: ability to do the right thing in the right way for the right reason; requires real-world experience. |
| [[life-planning-skills]] | 2026-09-25 | 2026-09-25 | Competencies for settling, coordinating, and executing long-term goals; integrated exercise of multiple capacities. |
